{:intent "RECEIPT-BOOL-001"
 :id :RECEIPT-BOOL-001
 :status :active
 :ears "When a versioned write verb or the probe CLI publishes receipt booleans, the test suite shall require an executable false witness for each field."
 :misreadings ["An always-true computed expression counts as evidence."
               "A field missing from a failure receipt is a false witness."
               "A new verb can omit registration because the old two still pass."
               "Already-false fields need no scenario."]
 :boundaries ["Returned receipt and durable per-file evidence" "New verbs" "New nested fields" "Post-write external mutation"]
 :tests [every-receipt-boolean-has-a-driven-false-witness unregistered-verbs-and-fields-fail-by-name]
 :rationale "Opus found the same unwitnessed receipt-boolean class in insertion and alias rename, 2026-09-11."
 :rule "Every boolean path discovered in committed write receipts or a passed probe verdict needs an observed literal-false witness. Probe's verification_complete remains false because warm success is not cold proof. Failure-only fields are covered by publication/recovery groups, not this discovery claim."
 :verbs
 {"probe" {:verification_complete :behavior-not-run}
  "insert_forms"
  {:committed :stage-failure :ok :stage-failure :mutation_attempted :stage-failure
   :source_unchanged :completed-write :verification_complete :behavior-not-run
   :write_verified :neighbor-corruption :other_forms_unchanged :neighbor-corruption}
  "rename_alias"
  {:committed :stage-failure :ok :stage-failure :mutation_attempted :stage-failure
   :source_unchanged :completed-write :verification_complete :behavior-not-run
   :write_verified :neighbor-corruption :other_forms_unchanged :neighbor-corruption
   :partial_write :completed-write :gaps_unchanged :trivia-corruption
   :discards_unchanged :discard-corruption}}}
